<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FTL>

<event name="ADDON_RAD_INFO_2">
    <text>R&amp;D
Developed by: Arc
Currently Disabled.

An addon designed around the use of Lua to create fun and unique gimmicks, this includes a variety of ships, weapons, crew, drones, and quests, although not entirely balanced they all try to introduce and focus on a unique gimmick you wouldn't find in MV otherwise.

To enable R&amp;D, go to the Multiverse Forums and visit the addon section!</text>
</event>
<event name="ADDON_AEA_2">
	<text>FTL: The Outer Expansion
Developed by: Arc
Currently Disabled.
        
Adds new races, sectors, ships, and weapons, currently implemented: The Acidic Growth.
        
To enable The Outer Expansion, go to the Multiverse Forums and visit the addon section!</text>
</event>
<event name="ADDON_FISH_2">
	<text>FTL: FISHIER THAN LIGHT
Developed by: Arc
Currently Disabled.
      
FTL Fishing, what more do I need to say. Over 60 fish, all with unique uses and effects.
      
To enable Fishier Than Light, go to the Multiverse Forums and visit the addon section!</text>
</event>
<event name="ADDON_GOF_2">
	<text>FTL: GALAXY ON FIRE
Developed by: Arc
Currently Disabled.
        
Adds 3 ships, 40 new weapons, 2 new crew, and 1 new event based on the galaxy on fire franchise. All weapons function in completely new ways never seen before using brand new lua functions.
        
To enable Galaxy On Fire, go to the Multiverse Forums and visit the addon section!</text>
</event>

<!--
	 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\
	 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\
			                    HANGAR OBJECTS
	 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\
	 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\
-->

<mod:findName type="event" name="START_BEACON_PREP_LOAD">
	<mod-append:backgroundObject name="FISHING_ROD_1_OBJECT">
		<layer z="0">background</layer>
		<spawnArea x="714" y="88" w="0" h="0" center="true"/>
		<anim>fishing_rod_1_icon_select</anim>
		<hoverAnim>fishing_rod_1_icon_select_on</hoverAnim>
		<inactiveAnim hide="true"/>
		<tooltip>An old rusty fishing harpoon.</tooltip>
		<clickAction>
			<event load="FISH_GIVE_BAD_ROD"/>
			<destroy/>
		</clickAction>
	</mod-append:backgroundObject>
</mod:findName>

<event name="FISH_GIVE_BAD_ROD">
	<text>You notice an old fishing harpoon lying around, you decide to take it with you.</text>
	<weapon name="FISHING_ROD_0"/>
	<unlockCustomShip silent="false">PLAYER_SHIP_FISHING</unlockCustomShip>
</event>

<mod:findName type="event" name="BOON_SELECT">
	<mod:findLike type="loadEventList">
		<mod-append:event name="BOON_SELECT_FISH" req="prof_r_boon_fish" />
	</mod:findLike>
</mod:findName>

<event name="FISH_CHOOSE_ANY">
	<text>You notice an old fishing harpoon lying around, you decide to take it with you.</text>
	<weapon name="FISHING_ROD_0"/>
	<unlockCustomShip silent="false">PLAYER_SHIP_FISHING</unlockCustomShip>
</event>

<mod:findName type="event" name="START_BEACON_PREP_OPTIONS">
		<mod-append:choice hidden="true" req="FISH_WEIGHT_RECORD_TOTAL" lvl="100" blue="false">
        <text>Visit the fish locker.</text>
        <event>
            <text>Grab a fish from the collection of previous renegades.</text>
            <choice hidden="false" blue="false" req="FISH_WEIGHT_RECORD_TOTAL" lvl="100">
                <text>[Rookie] Get a normal fish.</text>
                <event>
                    <weapon name="FISHLIST_1" />
                    <text>You present your fishing credentials to the crustodeans.  "Alright slugger, one fish coming up!"</text>
                    <choice hidden="false" blue="false">
                        <text>Continue...</text>
                    </choice>
                </event>
            </choice>
            <choice hidden="false" blue="false" req="FISH_WEIGHT_RECORD_TOTAL" lvl="2000">
                <text>[Challenger] Get a big fish.</text>
                <event>
                    <weapon name="FISHLIST_2" />
                    <text>You present your fishing credentials to the crustodeans.  "You got it boss, here's your fish!"</text>
                    <choice hidden="false" blue="false">
                        <text>Continue...</text>
                    </choice>
                </event>
            </choice>
            <choice hidden="false" blue="false" req="FISH_WEIGHT_RECORD_TOTAL" lvl="5000">
                <text>[Master] Get a huge fish.</text>
                <event>
                    <weapon name="FISHLIST_3" />
                    <text>You present your fishing credentials to the crustodeans.  "Whoa, alright!  Hey fellas, pull out the big ones!"</text>
                    <choice hidden="false" blue="false">
                        <text>Continue...</text>
                    </choice>
                </event>
            </choice>
            <choice hidden="false" blue="false" req="FISH_WEIGHT_RECORD_TOTAL" lvl="10000">
                <text>[Grand Master] Get a legendary fish.</text>
                <event>
                    <weapon name="FISHLIST_LEG" />
                    <text>You present your fishing credentials to the crustodeans.  "Well now that's not something you see every day." He nods. "Your items will be beamed abord presently."</text>
                    <choice hidden="false" blue="false">
                        <text>Continue...</text>
                    </choice>
                </event>
            </choice>
            <choice hidden="false" blue="false" req="FISH_WEIGHT_RECORD_TOTAL" lvl="500">
                <text>[Professional] Get a fish gun.</text>
                <event>
                    <weapon name="FISHLIST_GUNS" />
                    <text>You present your fishing credentials to the crustodeans.  Eyes glinting, they hand you a gunfish. "I see you're a renegade of fine taste! You gotta tell me how it does for you after you take it for a spin."</text>
                    <choice hidden="false" blue="false">
                        <text>Continue...</text>
                    </choice>
                </event>
            </choice>
            <choice hidden="false" blue="false" req="FISH_WEIGHT_RECORD_TOTAL" lvl="100000">
                <text>[Fish Lord] Take your pick of everything. todo add this</text>
                <event>
                    <text>You stride into the Hall of Fish, clearing the security checkpoint with a flash of your cod-tier fishing creds. Rows upon rows of fish unfold before you. Never before nor since has such a collection been at one captain's disposal.  You muse over your options...</text>
                    <choice hidden="false" blue="false">
                        <text>Continue...</text>
                        <event load="FISH_ULTRA_RARE" />
                    </choice>
                </event>
            </choice>
        </event>
    </mod-append:choice>
</mod:findName>


<mod:findName type="event" name="START_BEACON_REAL" limit="1">
  <mod:findLike type="eventButton">
    <mod:selector name="ADDON_FMCORE"/>
    <mod:removeTag/>
  </mod:findLike>
  <mod:findLike type="eventButton">
    <mod:selector name="ADDON_FORGEMASTER"/>
    <mod:removeTag/>
